OL,3,GNEWSAMore controls possible as
OL,4,Areservoir level drops
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdditional water usage restrictions
OL,7,Fcould be introduced after South West
OL,8,FWater said a reservoir had dropped to
OL,9,Fjust 18% full.
OL,11,FAfter introducing a hosepipe ban in
OL,12,FAugust, the company is now applying to
OL,13,Fthe government to potentially bring in
OL,14,Fa Non-Essential Use Ban (NEUB), which
OL,15,Fwould restrict water usage by certain
OL,16,Fbusinesses.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
