OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1791273353
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMore controls possible as
OL,4,Areservoir level drops
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We don't want to impact businesses but
OL,7,Fthis is a last resort," said Sam
OL,8,FBottomley, director of water services
OL,9,Fat the firm, adding "reservoirs just
OL,10,Fhaven't recovered" after the hottest
OL,11,Fsummer on record.
OL,13,FHe said Wimbleball reservoir on Exmoor
OL,14,Fwas under 20% full. Devon, Cornwall and
OL,15,Fthe Isles of Scilly were among seven
OL,16,Fareas of England to be declared in
OL,17,Fdrought in July.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
